{"text": "PHILIP MORRIS U.S. A.\nINTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nRichmond, Virginia\n\nTo: _C. Higgins Date: July 8, 1992\n\nFrom: U, Smith\nSubject: Summary for the week of July 8, 1992\n\n1, The new 2 inch by 3 inch GATE ARRAY test circuit will be revised to\nincorporate changes in design and also to include surface mount diodes.\n\n2. Ihave received the printed circuit boards from KELTECH CIRCUITS INC., for\nthe eight puff device charger. The Charger circuit has been assembled.\nTesting of this unit will begin.\n\nesporeozoe",
